   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The preposition «um» for times",
     "texto": [
      "In German, each time dimension has its own preposition:",
      "1. **Exact hours → um:**",
      "**Um wie viel Uhr?** (At what time?)",
      "**Ich stehe um sieben Uhr auf.** (I get up at seven).",
      "**Wir essen um halb zwei.** (We eat at half past one).",
      "**Der Kurs fängt um Viertel nach neun an.** (The course starts at quarter past nine).",
      "2. **Contrast with days and parts of the day:**",
      "Times: **um** (um acht Uhr, um halb neun).",
      "Days and weekend: **am** (am Montag, am Wochenende).",
      "Parts of the day as adverbs: no preposition (**morgens, abends, nachts**).",
      "For periods: **von... bis...** (from... to...): **Ich arbeite von neun bis fünf Uhr** (I work from nine to five)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
